{"id":"6c4d010edfaaea6b","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-program-envelope.md","title":"df program envelope","display":"df program envelope","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-program-envelope","aliases":["72-df-program-envelope"],"display":"df program envelope","depends_on":["[[72-df-four-valued-structure]]","[[72-df-program-definition-form]]","[[72-df-inductive-definition]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §§3.1–3.3, print650–653/PDF662–665; fixed-base formulation","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"proved-in-note by complete-lattice least-prefixed-point argument","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-program-envelope"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-program-envelope</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df program envelope"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40bb12b12b7a39e7\" href=\"?note=40bb12b12b7a39e7\" title=\"72-df-four-valued-structure\">72-df-four-valued-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9586f246c1c6084\" href=\"?note=d9586f246c1c6084\" title=\"72-df-program-definition-form\">72-df-program-definition-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bf103f8baf1db1b8\" href=\"?note=bf103f8baf1db1b8\" title=\"72-df-inductive-definition\">72-df-inductive-definition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §§3.1–3.3, print650–653/PDF662–665; fixed-base formulation"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note by complete-lattice least-prefixed-point argument"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定非空D及全部函数/常数解释，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_\\Sigma(D)\">\\(K_\\Sigma(D)\\)</span> 是所有该基底上四值关系解释组成的集合，按逐坐标信息序为完备格；底结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 的全部原子关系值为u。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 是有限逻辑程序，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_R^P\">\\(D_R^P\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9586f246c1c6084\" href=\"?note=d9586f246c1c6084\" title=\"72-df-program-definition-form\">72-df-program-definition-form</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\">\\(R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\)</span>，固定长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_R(R)\">\\(a_R(R)\\)</span> 的互异变量元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}\">\\(\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_R^P(\\vec x)\">\\(D_R^P(\\vec x)\\)</span> 直接取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9586f246c1c6084\" href=\"?note=d9586f246c1c6084\" title=\"72-df-program-definition-form\">72-df-program-definition-form</a> 的确定实例。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_{\\vec x\\mapsto\\vec d}\">\\(s_{\\vec x\\mapsto\\vec d}\\)</span> 任取给该变量元组赋 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec d\">\\(\\vec d\\)</span> 的赋值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_R^P(\\vec x)\">\\(D_R^P(\\vec x)\\)</span> 的自由变量限于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span>，故其余赋值不影响结果。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_P\">\\(\\mathcal E_P\\)</span> 为P-envelope算子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\">\\(M,N\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在K的乘积表示中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(R)(\\vec d)=R^M(\\vec d)\">\\(M(R)(\\vec d)=R^M(\\vec d)\\)</span>；共同域与函数解释补回完整结构。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR^{\\mathcal E_P(M)}(\\vec d)&amp;:=⟦ D_R^P(\\vec x)⟧_{M,s_{\\vec x\\mapsto\\vec d}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal E_P(M)\\sqsubseteq M,\\\\\nI_P&amp;:=\\mathop{\\sqcap}\\{M\\in K_\\Sigma(D):\\mathcal E_P(M)\\sqsubseteq M\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal E_P(I_P)&amp;=I_P,\\qquad\\forall M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\\ (\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)\\to I_P\\sqsubseteq M).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR^{\\mathcal E_P(M)}(\\vec d)&amp;:=⟦ D_R^P(\\vec x)⟧_{M,s_{\\vec x\\mapsto\\vec d}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal E_P(M)\\sqsubseteq M,\\\\\nI_P&amp;:=\\mathop{\\sqcap}\\{M\\in K_\\Sigma(D):\\mathcal E_P(M)\\sqsubseteq M\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal E_P(I_P)&amp;=I_P,\\qquad\\forall M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\\ (\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)\\to I_P\\sqsubseteq M).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K_\\Sigma(D):=\\prod_{R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}}\\mathsf{Four}^{D^{a_R(R)}},\\qquad U(R)(\\vec d):=\\mathsf u.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K_\\Sigma(D):=\\prod_{R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}}\\mathsf{Four}^{D^{a_R(R)}},\\qquad U(R)(\\vec d):=\\mathsf u.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\mathop{\\sqcap}\\mathcal A\\right)(R)(\\vec d):=\\mathop{\\sqcap}_{M\\in\\mathcal A}R^M(\\vec d)\\quad(\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal A\\subseteq K_\\Sigma(D)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\mathop{\\sqcap}\\mathcal A\\right)(R)(\\vec d):=\\mathop{\\sqcap}_{M\\in\\mathcal A}R^M(\\vec d)\\quad(\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal A\\subseteq K_\\Sigma(D)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>IX§3.2.1–3.2.3给出envelope与充分结构的前不动点条件；本书随后§3.3用超限迭代得到最小充分结构。公式单调性使E_P单调；前不动点族非空（顶结构在其中），完备格最小前不动点证明与72-df-inductive-definition的两次单调性论证相同，故I_P为最小不动点。本节点固定基底，未将不同论域的结构作同一格内的比较。源书对equational结构另有CET约束；本定义的实际身份等号模型为明确的语义版本，Herbrand基底是其源书特例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-four-valued-structure","status":"resolved","id":"40bb12b12b7a39e7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-four-valued-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-program-definition-form","status":"resolved","id":"d9586f246c1c6084","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-program-definition-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-inductive-definition","status":"resolved","id":"bf103f8baf1db1b8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-inductive-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-program-definition-form","status":"resolved","id":"d9586f246c1c6084","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定非空D及全部函数/常数解释，$K_\\Sigma(D)$ 是所有该基底上四值关系解释组成的集合，按逐坐标信息序为完备格；底结构 $U$ 的全部原子关系值为u。$P$ 是有限逻辑程序，$D_R^P$ 如 [[72-df-program-definition-form]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-program-definition-form","status":"resolved","id":"d9586f246c1c6084","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对每个 $R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}$，固定长度为 $a_R(R)$ 的互异变量元组 $\\vec x$；$\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}$。$D_R^P(\\vec x)$ 直接取 [[72-df-program-definition-form]] 的确定实例。$s_{\\vec x\\mapsto\\vec d}$ 任取给该变量元组赋 $\\vec d$ 的赋值；$D_R^P(\\vec x)$ 的自由变量限于 $\\vec x$，故其余赋值不影响结果。$\\mathcal E_P$ 为P-envelope算子，$M,N\\in K_\\Sigma(D)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"K_\\Sigma(D)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"D_R^P","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}","display":false},{"tex":"a_R(R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}","display":false},{"tex":"D_R^P(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"s_{\\vec x\\mapsto\\vec d}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec d","display":false},{"tex":"D_R^P(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_P","display":false},{"tex":"M,N\\in K_\\Sigma(D)","display":false},{"tex":"M(R)(\\vec d)=R^M(\\vec d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nR^{\\mathcal E_P(M)}(\\vec d)&:=⟦ D_R^P(\\vec x)⟧_{M,s_{\\vec x\\mapsto\\vec d}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal E_P(M)\\sqsubseteq M,\\\\\nI_P&:=\\mathop{\\sqcap}\\{M\\in K_\\Sigma(D):\\mathcal E_P(M)\\sqsubseteq M\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal E_P(I_P)&=I_P,\\qquad\\forall M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\\ (\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)\\to I_P\\sqsubseteq M).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"K_\\Sigma(D):=\\prod_{R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}}\\mathsf{Four}^{D^{a_R(R)}},\\qquad U(R)(\\vec d):=\\mathsf u.","display":true},{"tex":"\\left(\\mathop{\\sqcap}\\mathcal A\\right)(R)(\\vec d):=\\mathop{\\sqcap}_{M\\in\\mathcal A}R^M(\\vec d)\\quad(\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal A\\subseteq K_\\Sigma(D)).","display":true}],"bytes":2697,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-274","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-program-envelope|df program envelope]]"},{"id":"7fdc7a7a93d79109","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-program-envelope]] 的 $P$ 与基底 $D,(c^M),(f^M)$，$M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)$，$U$ 是该基底的全 $\\mathsf u$ 结构。$\\mathcal E_P$ 与 $I_P$ 使用同一基底。$n,m\\in\\omega$；$M_P^{[n]}$ 和 $J_P^n$ 由下式递归引入，不预设 $M\\sqsubseteq\\mathcal E_P(M)$。"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-program-envelope]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-274","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-program-envelope|df program envelope]]"},{"id":"aeeeb6862efb50c6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-program-envelope]] 的D、函数解释、有限程序P、$K_\\Sigma(D),I_P$；$\\operatorname{Lower}(M)$ 指所有R、⃗d的值均不等于c。A为本语言公式，s为D赋值。$P\\models^{D}_{4}A$ 与 $P\\models^{D}_{\\rm low}A$ 分别量化该固定基底上的全部充分四值、充分lower三值结构。"},{"id":"141c93aa59eed1f8","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma$，$A\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma$，$\\mathsf{pcomp}_\\Sigma(P)$ 和 signed translation 采用 [[72-df-partial-program-completion]]。$\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)$ 是 [[72-df-program-envelope]] 在 $M$ 的自身基底上的前不动点条件；$\\operatorname{Lower}$ 采用 [[72-thm-least-adequate-lower-structure]]；$\\vdash^-,\\vdash^-_0$ 采用 [[72-thm-identity-free-cut-elimination]] 的 calculus。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-program-envelope]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-program-envelope|72-df-program-envelope]]"}],"outgoing":["40bb12b12b7a39e7","d9586f246c1c6084","bf103f8baf1db1b8"]}